WEBVTT

00:02:56.505 --> 00:03:00.009
and managing the daily stresses
of systemic racism,

00:03:00.051 --> 00:03:01.636
sexism and classism.

00:03:02.803 --> 00:03:04.722
Now a key part of the model

00:03:04.764 --> 00:03:08.684
is that in return
for the gift of a day off,

00:03:08.726 --> 00:03:13.105
people are willing to squeeze
all their productivity into four days.

00:03:13.522 --> 00:03:17.026
So while they may be spending
less time at work,

00:03:17.068 --> 00:03:20.488
they're not necessarily doing less work.

00:03:21.113 --> 00:03:24.742
The secret sauce is work reorganization,

00:03:24.784 --> 00:03:27.662
cutting out the least
productive activities.

00:03:28.037 --> 00:03:30.498
Meetings are a prime target.